# Saved eval runs. Useful locally for comparing one prompt against another;
# not worth versioning, since each is a timestamped snapshot of a stochastic
# component rather than a fact about the code.
runs/

# What was said to the camera, on the camera that heard it. Same reasoning
# as runs/: a record of one device's use, not a fact about the code. It is
# also the raw material for future eval cases, so it wants reading, not
# versioning.
logs/
.DS_Store
